
Rem --- Setup Screen ---
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Flash Off : Curs Off : Hide
Palette 0,$0,$FFF,$F00,$0F0

Rem --- Correct Buffer Command for AMOS Pro ---
Set Sprite Buffer 256

Rem --- Draw a 16x16 box on the screen ---
Ink 2
Bar 0,0 To 16,16

Rem --- Correct Get Sprite Syntax using "To" ---
Get Sprite 1,0,0 To 16,16

Rem --- Clear screen to prove it is a hardware sprite ---
Cls 0

Rem --- Display the grabbed sprite ---
X=150
Y=100
Sprite 1,X,Y,1

Wait Key
